**/data/
**/db/
**/*.wt
**/WiredTiger*
**/journal/
**/diagnostic.data/
**/_mdb_catalog.wt
**/sizeStorer.wt
**/storage.bson
**/mongod.lock
**/mongos.lock
**/*.turtle
**/*diagnostic.data/

# ============================================
# Logs 
# ============================================
**/*.log
**/log/
**/logs/

